{
  "name": "Psyche",
  "type": "character",
  "img": "systems/heroic5e/assets/characters/psyche/Portrait-Psyche.png",
  "system": {
    "biography": "Zoey Kane — Psyche\n\n“Chaos With A Heart”\n\nClass: Sentinel\nOrigin: Enhanced\nCalling: Chaos & Connection\nSide: Heroic\n\nDescription Psyche is one of the strangest young heroes in the city and very possibly one of the most dangerous. A powerful psychic with an emotionally chaotic mind, Zoey experiences thoughts, emotions, memories, and mental noise more intensely than most people can comprehend. Rather than trying to hide her eccentricity, she embraces it completely through bizarre fashion, theatrical behavior, colorful makeup, and an almost surreal sense of humor. To some people she seems ridiculous. To others, unsettling. But beneath the rainbow-goth weirdness is an extraordinarily perceptive and emotionally intelligent young woman who understands people better than they understand themselves. Her unpredictability often masks just how powerful her mind truly is. Personality Creative, emotionally impulsive, playful, deeply sensitive, and wildly expressive. Zoey uses humor, color, weirdness, and constant emotional noise as armor against loneliness and overstimulation. She can shift from goofy to heartbreakingly sincere in seconds and often sees through emotional facades immediately. Powers Psyche possesses powerful telepathic and empathic abilities, including mind-reading, emotional sensing, illusion casting, psychic projections, telekinetic manipulation, memory intrusion, and surreal psychic manifestations shaped directly by emotion and imagination.",
    "notes": "Combat Reference\nPower Die: d8\nProwess: +2\nTrained Saves: DEX, PER.\nTrained Skills: Influence, Insight, Investigation, Notice, Stealth.\nClass EV (PER): 15\nTelekinesis EV (WIS): 14\nIllusion EV (CHA): 14",
